# What a local `docker build` must not copy into the image (the Dockerfile's
# `COPY . .`). CI checks out none of these, so its images don't change.

# Secrets: Next copies .env into .next/standalone, so a local build would ship it
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*-service-account*.json
*.iam.gserviceaccount.com.json

# Built or installed here: the image installs and builds its own (the deps
# stage's node_modules would otherwise be overwritten with this machine's)
node_modules
.next
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# Test output and saved test sessions
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
playwright/.auth
.playwright-cli

# The old site's dump has member data (data/ is otherwise needed)
data/lentokerho.sql
